[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: One held graph per workspace serves every reader

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SCRIBE-HOLDS-ONE-GRAPH
TITLE: One held graph per workspace serves every reader
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
A scribe daemon shall hold one workspace's graph and answer reads from it
without rebuilding. A render shall obtain its payload from that same held
graph rather than paying its own load.

The graph may be rebuilt only when a write has marked it dirty, when a
reference cannot be resolved against it, or on explicit request.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: DEC-SCRIBE-DEFERS-THE-REBUILD
  ROLE: Governed_By
